2 CONT * d)         '''ALBRECHT [V] von Mecklenburg''' (-[1 Jun/6 Dec] 1423, bur Gadebusch).  Minor until 1415.  He was joint founder of the University of Rostock in 1419, jointly with his first cousin Johann IV Herzog von Mecklenburg[53
2 CONC 2].  Betrothed (1423) to MARGARETA von Brandenburg, daughter of FRIEDRICH I Elector of Brandenburg & his wife Elisabeth von Bayern-Landshut ([1410]-Landshut 27 Jul 1465, bur Kloster Seligenthal). 
