2 CONT Erengisle Torkelsson Barun (boat)  Birthdate: estimated between 1288 and 1340  Death: Died 1340 
2 CONT
2 CONT Known between 1329 and 1340. Arms: boat. Gift (Raneke s 561, ÄSF s 175, 186, 239) Örnberg: Called 1329 Peter Gregersson genes. Sealed 1331 his will, errands a farm 1332. Chief in Finland 1334-1337. Sealed Marg .Rock's daughter's t
2 CONC estament 1340 and was then a knight. Witnessed 1329 testaments by Birger Röriksson who calls him "genes". Married to 1322 & 1325 with Birgers sister Christina Röriksdtr. Eringisles widow got married to Lars Magnusson (Leopard and 
2 CONC half lily), who was knight than 1360 when his son Matthias lived. Then the monk in Eskilstuna, died before 1374. Source Örnberg, who believes that the sons Knut and Tyrgil's mother were Christina and that Eringisles father was nam
2 CONC ed Anders and lived in the late 1200's. -------------------- Ref Fredrik Åhlander 
2 CONT
2 CONT Eringisle Torkelsson Barun Born before 1329 Death after 1340 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father knight Torkel Eringisleson Djäk Barun 
2 CONT
