2 CONT Henrickson's Chronicles state the Pomerania was formerly part of Poland until about 1190, then became a duchy under German sovereignty during the reign of Henry VI.  Pomerania had been under the rule of Denmark during the reign of
2 CONC  Canute IV, 1182. then part of Poland.
