2 CONT
2 CONT 1384-1422: JOHN IV (Johann IV.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in c. 1365.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Duke Magnus I of Mecklenburg. Mother: Duchess Elizabeth of Pomerania-Rügen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married firstly in 1399 in Schwerin Jutta von Hoya (+1415).
2 CONT
2 CONT Married secondly in 1416 Catherine of Saxe-Lauenburg (+c. 1448).
2 CONT
2 CONT His issue who reigned: HENRY IV (*1417,+1477; son of Catherine).
2 CONT
2 CONT Died in 1422 at Schwerin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Buried at Doberan Minster.
2 CONT
2 CONT His first consort Duchess Jutta von Hoya was buried in Schwerin Cathedral.
2 CONT --------------------
