2 CONT Sophia Valdemarsdottir  F, #105479, b. 1217, d. 1247 Last Edited=10 May 2003
2 CONT      Sophia Valdemarsdottir was born in 1217. She was the daughter of Valdemar II 'the Victorious' Valdemarsson, King of Denmark and Berengaria de Portugal. She married Johann I Markgraf von Brandenburg, son of Albrecht II Markgra
2 CONC f von Brandenburg and Matilde von der Lausitz, circa 1236.1 She died in 1247.1 Children of Sophia Valdemarsdottir and Johann I Markgraf von Brandenburg Heinrich I Markgraf von Brandenburg+ d. 1318 Konrad I Markgraf von Brandenburg
2 CONC + d. 1304 Johann II Markgraf von Brandenburg+ d. 1281 Otto IV Markgraf von Brandenburg d. bt 1308 - 1309 Erich von Brandenburg d. 1295 Albrecht von Brandenburg Hermann von Brandenburg d. b Sep 1291 Mechtild von Brandenburg Agnes v
2 CONC on Brandenburg+ d. 1304 Helene von Brandenburg+ b. c 1241/42, d. 7 Jun 1304 Citations [S16] Jirí Louda and Michael MacLagan, Lines of Succession: Heraldry of the Royal Families of Europe, 2nd edition (London, U.K.: Little, Brown a
2 CONC nd Company, 1999), table 16. Hereinafter cited as Lines of Succession. _______________________________________________________________
