1 NAME Truid Nielsen /Due/
2 GIVN Truid Nielsen
2 SURN Due
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1310
2 PLAC Tubetorp
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Danmark
1 DEAT
2 DATE BEF 1350
2 PLAC Vangaa
