2 CONT * Father of Karl Pik and Åke Pik
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT The ancestor of the Pik family was a pilgrim named Tyrgil who took the surname Pik after the walking stick these pilgrims carried on their journeys. Tyrgil should have lived in the latter half of the twelfth century
