2 CONT King Birger 's letter to Husby-Trögd for Queen Märta.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources: Post-medieval Regest / Note:  Ericus Olai (SRS II: 1, p. 73) Printed regest
2 CONT Schück, The Kingdom's Letters and Registers (1976), p. 45 no. 25.  Literature and commentary See Fritz, House, Land and County (1972-73 / 1992) Last Modified 2015-06-05.  Date comment:  about 1300 
2 CONT
