2 TITL Count Bernard of Anhalt, Duke of Saxony 1140-1212  Husband of Judyta Mieszkówna; Sophia von Thüringen; Jutta Knudsdatter af Danmark, Herzogin zu Sachsen; Julia von Ascanen and Countess Brigette of Denmarkis your 23rd great grandfa
