2 CONT
2 CONT Henry I, Markgraf von Brandenburg is Queen Elizabeth II's 15th great grandfather.
2 CONT
2 CONT Margrave Henry I (nicknamed Henry Lackland; 21 March 1256 – 14 February 1318) was a member of the House of Ascania and Margrave of Brandenburg-Stendal and Landsberg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry I, Margrave of Brandenburg-Stendal
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry I and Otto IV
2 CONT
2 CONT Born:	21 March 1256
2 CONT
2 CONT Died:	14 February 1318 (aged 61)
2 CONT
2 CONT Noble family:	House of Ascania
2 CONT
