2 CONC ried Bogislaw II, Duke of Pomerania at Stettin 2.Swietopelk II, Duke of Pomerania, succeeded his father as Duke of Pomerelia, from 1227 of Pomerelia-Gdańsk 3.Hedwig (Jadwiga), married Duke Władysław Odonic of Greater Poland 4.Wito
2 CONC sława, prioress of Żukowo Abbey 5.Warcisław, Duke at Świecie from 1227 6.Sambor II, Duke at Lubiszewo from 1233 7.Ratibor, Duke at Białogard from 1233 8.Milosława, nun at Żukowo Abbey
