2 CONT Henry had the following known children:
2 CONT
2 CONT by his first wife, Clementia (divorced 1162), daughter of Conrad, Duke of Zähringen and Clemence of Namur: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gertrude of Bavaria (1155-1197), married first Frederick IV, Duke of Swabia, and then King Canute VI of Denmark 
2 CONT
2 CONT Richenza (c. 1157 - 1167) 
2 CONT
2 CONT by his second wife, Matilda, daughter of King Henry II of England (married 1168): 
2 CONT
2 CONT Matilda (1171-1210), married Godfrey, Count of Perche, and Enguerrand III, Lord of Coucy 
2 CONT
2 CONT Richenza (1172-1204), was engaged to King Valdemar II of Denmark 
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry V, Count Palatine of the Rhine (c. 1173-1227) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lothar of Bavaria (c. 1174-1190) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Otto IV, Holy Roman Emperor and Duke of Swabia (c. 1175-1218) 
2 CONT
2 CONT William of Winchester (1184-1213) 
2 CONT
