2 CONT '''Karl Ulfsson (Sparre av Tofta)''' gives his wife Ingrid Eriksdotter in the morning gift farm Strandby (Kungs-Husby parish, Trögds county), property in Staby and Grönsö, Bond-Arnö parish (Trögds county), with all the preparation
2 CONC s. The knights were the knights Karl Näskonungsson, Rörik Bonde, Karl Ulfsson and Filip Ragvaldsson, the canyon Johan Karlsson in Uppsala and the canyon Birger Gregersson in Strängnäs, the weapons Verner van Kyren, Finvid Finvidss
2 CONC on, Karl Törnesson, Bengt Fadersson, Svens Fadersson and Birger Nilsson.  Nils Abjörnsson, Puke Glysing, Erengisle Sunesson, Bengt Algotsson, Margareta Sunedotter seals. - https://sok.riksarkivet.se/dokument/sdhk/6374.pdf
