2 CONT Karl-Henrik Karlsson: Duke Bengt Algotsson's ancestral lineage Table of contents Table of contents ... 2 Duke Bengt Algotsson's ancestral lineage ... 3 Appendix A Supplements and amendments ... 5 A.1 Supplements ... 5 A.2 Source l
