1 OCCU Väpnaren och häradshövdingen i Frökinds härad i Västergötland, en tid, Häradshövding, Fogde, Häradshövding i Frökinds härad, Axvalla
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Bengt Dun (sparre)==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Olof Ryting
2 CONT * The gunman and the chief of the district in Frökinds, in Västergötland, a time spent at Axevalla castle, Bengt Dun (sparrow), lived in 1461.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Married==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: '''Bengta Abjörnsdotter (Bagge af Berga)'''  daughter of Abjörn Jönsson (Bagge af Berga) and Karin Dansdotter
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children==
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Gyrit Bengtsdotter,''' Riding (Sparre) to Häggetorp, married Brun Svensson Forstenaætten to Häggetorp.  Brun Svensson (son of Sven Brynjulfsson, tab 1), to Häggetorp in Dala parish, Skaraborg County. The Chief of Valla in Val
2 CONC la ruled in Skaraborg County in 1489 and still in 1495. He took up the maternal weapon: the spar over a leaf. Married to his brother Gyrit Bengtsdotter (Ryting), daughter of the gunman and the governor Bengt Dun (sparrow), to Hägg
2 CONC etorp, and Bengta Åbjörnsdotter ( Bagge af Berga ).
2 CONT
2 CONT ==SDHK No: 27650==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Swedish Diplomatarium's main directory of medieval letters''' - https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Bengt+Dun&EndastDigitaliserat=false&Fritext=Bengt+Dun&AvanceradSok=True&page=3&postid=sdhk_27650&tab=post&FacettState=undefined%
2 CONC 3Ac%7C#tab
2 CONT
2 CONT Dating: 1460 August 26, of issue Tuna 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Content'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Bengt "Dwe" (Dun) Sells to Svarte Ture Jönsson a farm in the "Ylestada" parish, Vartofta herded.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources''' Post-medieval transcripts:  B 16 fol. 435v, no 74, RA0202 (see prints of B 16 texts, DK)
2 CONT
2 CONT ==SDHK No: 27415==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Swedish Diplomatarium's main directory of medieval letters''' - https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Bengt+Dun&EndastDigitaliserat=false&Fritext=Bengt+Dun&AvanceradSok=True&page=1&postid=sdhk_27415&tab=post&FacettState=undefined%
2 CONC 3Ac%7C#tab
2 CONT
2 CONT Dating: 1459 May 24, of issue Vadstena 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Content'''
2 CONT
2 CONT The gunman Bengt Dun and his wife Bengta give goods and farm in the Kälvene parish in Vartofta herded in Skara diocese to Vadstena monastery.
2 CONT
2 CONT The guards seal together with the gunman Sven Larsson, Erengisle Eskilsson and Jöns Gudmundsson, mayor of Vadstena.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources:''' Original:  or. Perg. RA 0101  pictures, Medieval transcripts:  Vid. paperboard. odat., SDHK No. 27416
2 CONT Post-medieval transcriptions:  Peringskiöld: E 60: D fol. 131; Eagle Helmet: X p. 497 "1451" Literature and commentary Attached 1470 15/5, SDHK No. 29109 - https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=600000000509041
2 CONC 9659&photo_id=6000000131189585822&position=0
2 CONT
2 CONT ==SDHK No: 28914==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Swedish Diplomatarium's main directory of medieval letters''' - https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Bengt+Dun&EndastDigitaliserat=false&Fritext=Bengt+Dun&AvanceradSok=True&page=2&postid=sdhk_28914&tab=post&FacettState=undefined%
2 CONC 3Ac%7C#tab
2 CONT
2 CONT Dating: 1469 January 19, of issue Vadstena 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Content'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Bengt Dun and his wife Bengta, Abiörn Jönsson's daughter , certify that wife Märta Bengtsdotter gave a estate "Wathnöya" in Smula sn in Redväg hd under St. Birgitta's altar in Vadstena monastery.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources''' Original:  Or. Perg. RA 0101  pictures, Post-medieval transcriptions:  Peringskiöld: E 60: D f. 98v (reg.); Eagle helmet: X p. 729 - https://www.geni.com/photo/view/4519232?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000131
2 CONC 197683826
2 CONT ==Sources==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Sparre in Västergötland - http://www.roskildehistorie.dk/stamtavler/adel/Sparre/Vestergoetland.htm
2 CONT * Bag by Berga no. 118, Tab 3 - https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Bagge_af_Berga_nr_118
2 CONT * Forest Family # 2, Tab 6 - https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Forstenasl%C3%A4kten_nr_2
2 CONT * Get Person - https://www.uwe-zimbelmann.de/getperson.php?personID=I216624&tree=tree1
2 CONT * Sparre (nobility) - https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sparre_(adel)
