2 CONT Jon was probably after 1450 married to Gudrun Olavsdatter (c. 1415–1476/86), daughter of the knight Olav Håkonsson and Ingebjørg Jonsdotter. It is unknown if they ever had any children together. Jon died of drowning at Jersøy, nea
2 CONC r Tønsberg, the last man in the direct male line of the Smør family.
