2 CONT '''Gertraut of Hungary'''1 F, b. circa 1128, d. 3 October 1155
2 CONT
2 CONT *Father	Bela II 'the Blind', King of Hungary b. 1108, d. 13 Feb 1141
2 CONT *Mother	Helen of Serbia b. a 1109, d. 1146
2 CONT *Charts	Descendants of Charlemagne
2 CONT *     Gertraut of Hungary was born circa 1128 at of Esztergom, Hungary. She married Mieceslaus III, King of Poland, son of Boleslaw III 'Crooked Mouth (the Liar)', Duke & Grand Prince of Poland, Lord of Breslau, Krakow, & Sentomir
2 CONC  and Salomia von Limbourg, in 1136. Gertraut of Hungary died on 3 October 1155.
2 CONT *Family Mieceslaus III, King of Poland b. c 1126, d. 13 Mar 1202
2 CONT *Children	
2 CONT # Otto (Odon), Prince of Poznan & Kalisch+ b. c 1144, d. 20 Apr 1194
