2 CONT # Ludomilla Wierzchoslawa of Poland+ b. c 1150, d. b 1211
2 CONT # Judyta of Poland+ b. b 1154, d. a 12 Dec 1201
2 CONT
2 CONT *Citations [S5812] Unknown author, Europaische Stammtafeln by Isenburg, chart 154.
