2 CONT Hedwig von Brandenburg was the daughter of Albrecht I Markgraf von Brandenburg and Sophie von Wizenburg. She married Otto Markgraf von Meißen, son of Conrad Markgraf von Meißen and Luitgarde von Swabia, after 1159. 
