2 CONC aburg, Ottonis marchionis, Hermanni, Adelberti, Theoderici et Bernhardi comitum", by charter dated [end May/early Jun] 1151[99].  Canon of St Sebastian at Magdeburg 1151, provost in 1161 and 1176.
