1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Jadwiga Anhalcka''' – pierwsza żona księcia Bolesława II Rogatki. http://pl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jadwiga_Anhalcka
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage and Issue
2 CONT
2 CONT Around 8 May 1242, Bolesław married firstly with Hedwig (d. 21 December 1259), daughter of Henry I, Count of Anhalt. They had ten children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes (b. ca. 1243/50 - d. 13 March 1265), married ca. 1260/64 to Count Ulrich I of Württemberg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry V the Fat (b. ca. 1248 - d. 22 February 1296).
2 CONT
2 CONT Hedwig (b. ca. 1250/55 - d. aft. 1280), married ca. 1265/70 to Duke Konrad II of Masovia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bolko I the Strict (b. ca. 1252/56 - d. Grissow, 9 November 1301).
2 CONT
2 CONT Bernard the Lightsome (b. ca. 1253/57 - d. 25 April 1286).
2 CONT
2 CONT Konrad (d. young).
2 CONT
2 CONT Jarosław (d. young).
2 CONT
2 CONT Katharina (b. ca. 1255 - d. aft. 1270), Abbess of Trebnicz.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth (b. ca. 1259 - d. aft. 1268), married in 1268 to Louis of Hakeborn.
