1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/AUSTRIA.htm#GertrudDssAustriadied1288 Medlands]
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gertrude_of_Austria Wikipedia_EN]
2 CONT
2 CONT Gertrude was the only child of Henry of Austria, Duke of Mödling, by his wife Agnes, daughter of Hermann I, Landgrave of Thuringia. Henry, in turn, was the second son of Duke Leopold VI of Austria. In 1216, after the death of his 
2 CONC older brother Leopold, Henry became his father's heir.
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gertrud_von_Babenberg Wikipedia_DE]
2 CONT
2 CONT Nachkommen[Bearbeiten]
2 CONT
2 CONT Aus Gertruds Ehe mit Hermann von Baden entsprossen:
2 CONT
2 CONT #Friedrich (* 1249, + 29. Oktober 1268 Neapel, enthauptet mit Freund Konradin)
2 CONT #Agnes (* 1250, + 2. Jänner 1295), ∞ I. 1263 Herzog Ulrich III. von Spanheim (+ 1269), ∞ II. 1270 Graf Ulrich III. von Heunburg (+ 1308)
2 CONT
2 CONT Aus Gertruds Ehe mit Roman von Halicz entspross:
2 CONT
