2 CONT
2 CONT Second son of Władysław Odonic, Duke of Greater Poland and Hedwig. Married Jolenta (Yolanda) of Poland. They had three daughters.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Elisabeth of Kalisz c: 1263 - 28 Sept. 1304, married Henry V, Duke of Legnica.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Hedwig of Kalisz c: 1266 - 10 Dec. 1339, married Władysław I the Elbow-high, King of Poland.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Anna of Kalisz c:1278 - unknown, a nun in Gniezno.
2 CONT
