2 CONT     3. Royal Dau. of Eng., Eng. 120, v. 1, p. 57
2 CONT     4. Kings of Eng., Eng. 176, p. 59-87
2 CONT     5. Tab. Souv. Gen., France 22, Tab. 39
2 CONT     6. Burke's Peerage, Eng. P, 1949, pref. p. 252-53
2 CONT     7. Espolin (GS #12462 pt 1 p. 98-99)
1 NOTE !SOURCES:
2 CONT     1. Plantagenet Ancestry, Eng. 116, p. 41, 120
2 CONT     2. Dict. of Nat'l Biog., Eng. Pub. A, v. 17, p. 175-78, v. 26 p. 1-12
2 CONT     3. Royal Dau. of Eng., Eng. 120, v. 1, p. 57
2 CONT     4. Kings of Eng., Eng. 176, p. 59-87
