1 NOTE Reigned 1154-1189. He ruled an empire that stretched from the Tweed tothe
2 CONT Pyrenees. In spite of frequent hostitilties with the French King his own
2 CONT family and rebellious Barons (culminating in the great revolt of 1173-74)and
2 CONT his quarrel with Thomas Becket, Henry maintained control over hispossessions
