2 CONC ched from the Tweed to the Pyrenees.  He was the Founder of the Angevin, or Plantagenet, line. Henry was the first of fourteen hereditary kings, who were later referred to in the history oracles as Plantagenets.  He is more common
2 CONC ly known as FitzEmpress, Henry, II Curtmantle, King of England.
2 CONT
