1 NOTE Henry was the first of the Plantagenet-Angevin Dynasty.
2 CONT He was preceded by Stephen de Normandy. The nobility didn't take to Henry I naming Matilde as his successor to the throne. This opened the way for Stephen to take the throne from Matilde, Edith Sigulfson.
2 CONT The ensuing war was called the time of Anarchy for England. In the end, Stephen ceded and promised Matilde, Edith, that her son Henry II would ascend the throne after he died.
2 CONT Source:
2 CONT Stuart Roderick, W.
