2 CONT
2 CONT *In 1193, Henry married '''Agnes (born 1177, died 1204)''', daughter of '''Conrad, Count Palatine of the Rhine'''. 
2 CONT *Around 1209, he married Agnes (died 1248), daughter of Conrad II, Margrave of Lower Lusatia. 
2 CONT *He had the following children, all '''''from the first marriage''':''
