2 CONT * John II of Nuremberg (c. 1309 – 1357) was a Burgrave of Nuremberg from the House of Hohenzollern. He was the elder son of Frederick IV of Nuremberg and Margarete of Görz. 
2 CONT * Born: c. 1309
2 CONT * Died; July 31, 1357 (aged 47)
2 CONT * Noble Family: Hohenzollern
