2 CONT Mathilde von Brandenburg  F, #40365, b. 1296, d. before April 1321 Last Edited=10 May 2003 Consanguinity Index=0.12%
2 CONT      Mathilde von Brandenburg was born in 1296. She was the daughter of Hermann I Markgraf von Brandenburg and Anna von Habsburg. She married Heinrich IV Herzog von Sagan before 18 February 1321. She died before April 1321. ______
