2 CONT Marriage and Issue
2 CONT
2 CONT Around 1341, Louis married with Agnes (b. ca. 1321 - d. 7 July 1362), daughter of Henry IV, Duke of Głogów-Żagań and widow of Leszek, Duke of Racibórz. They had six children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Margareta (b. 1342/43 - d. 18/22 February 1386), married aft. 19 July 1353 to Albert I, Duke of Bavaria.
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry VIII with a Scar (b. 1343/45 - d. 11 July 1399).
2 CONT
2 CONT Katharina (b. ca. 1344 - d. 10 April 1404/4 October 1405?), Abbess of Trebnitz (1372).
2 CONT
2 CONT Hedwig (b. 1346 - d. 30 January 1385), married ca 1366 to John II, Duke of Auschwitz (Oświęcim).
2 CONT
2 CONT Wenceslaus (b. ca. 1350 - d. aft. 15 September 1358).
2 CONT
2 CONT A daughter (b. bef. July 1351 - d. young).
