1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dietrich III, (V) Graf von Honstein-Klettenberg
2 CONT
2 CONT Also known as Count Dietrich von Honstein zu Klettenberg 
2 CONT * Dietrich III, (V) Graf von Honstein-Klettenberg, elder in the house (1306), built Heringen Castle together with his brother Heinrich (1327), founder of the Heldrungian line (extinct ...), documented from 1286 to 1330, (* about 1
2 CONC 279; † between 29 September 1329 and 4 May 1330); Von (between 1305 and 1310) Elisabeth von Waldeck († after October 24, 1371), daughter of Count Otto I von Waldeck (–1305) and Sophie von Hessen (–1331)
2 CONT
2 CONT * c. 1300
