2 CONT
2 CONT      Catherine von Braunschweig was the daughter of Friedrich Herzog von Braunschweig and Anne von Sachsen. She married Heinrich XXIV Graf von Schwarzburg-Sondershausen circa 1413. She died before 26 November 1439.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Catherine von Braunschweig was a member of the House of Guelph.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Catherine von Braunschweig and Heinrich XXIV Graf von Schwarzburg-Sondershausen
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Anne von Schwarzburg-Sondershausen+
