1 NAME Niels /Johansen/ til Gudumlund
2 GIVN Niels
2 SURN Johansen
2 NSFX til Gudumlund
2 _MARNM Slet
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1350
2 PLAC Gudumlund, Ålborg
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE ABT 1395
2 PLAC Gudumlund, Ålborg
2 ADDR
1 OCCU Væbner og eier av Gudumlund 1373-1386
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://webcache.googleusercontent.com/search?q=cache:dP4hA0dZsF8J:danskekirker.blogspot.com/2009/09/gudum-kirke-og-gudumlundhimmerland.html+%22johannes+nielsen+slet%22&cd=6&hl=en&ct=clnk&source=www.google.comGenera
2 CONC tion 17
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------------
2 CONT 110600 Niels Johansen Slet
2 CONT
2 CONT 110601 Ide Lydersdatter Holck
2 CONT
2 CONT http://webcache.googleusercontent.com/search?q=cache:ZUkvOEBQIyYJ:www.elisabethborries.dk/14297327+%22niels+johansen+slet%22&cd=3&hl=en&ct=clnk&source=www.google.com
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Gudumlund manor was in 1373-86 owned by væbneren (knight) Niels Johansen Slet, by his son Johannes Nielsen Slet in 1390-93. In 1406 Erik of Pommern commanded Niels Slet's heirs to give his estates in Sejlflod to Viborg domkapitel 
2 CONC (chapter). Niels Slet's widow Ide Lydersdatter Holck gave in 1425 Gudumlund to Viborg chapter in return for Soul Masses for her family
2 CONT
2 CONT http://thyrashm.blogspot.no/2009/07/gudum-church-and-gudumlund-himmerland.html?m=1
1 FAMS @F6000000007645373653@
