1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Karl Tordsson Bonde==
2 CONT
2 CONT (TAB 8)
2 CONT
2 CONT Karl Bonde (son of Tord Bonde, Tab. 5 ). Died before 1446. Team in Västmanland. Circuit judge. National Council of the 1420s (nevertheless, never became knight). 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married no later than 1426 with Cecilia Bosdotter , daughter of the Danish-born knight and the castle captain of Stockholm Bo Tykesson Djure ( Dyre ) and Sigrid Uddormsdotter (winged arrow).
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Tord Farmer, marsh. Death 1456. See Tab. 9th
2 CONT * Bo Djure. Knight and counselor. Death 1465.
2 CONT * Sigrid Karlsdotter. Married before 1457-02-05 with the knight and riksrådet Stefan Ulfsson ( wolf ) to Stensta.
2 CONT * Birgitta Karlsdotter. Death 1494-07-05. Married 1457-01-16 Stockholm with the Knight and the Nils Sture National Council ( Night and Day ).
2 CONT * Ramborg Karlsdotter, dead young.
2 CONT
