2 CONC ekarne hd in Södermanland, which Helga Anudsdotter's son Erik Valdermansson (Folungaättens Valdemarsgren) gave his wife in the morning gift and this sold to Queen Margareta. Dog 26.4 1415 and was buried in Vadstena monastery. Född
