2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Svarte_Sk%C3%A5ning Black Scania, by Adelsvapen Geneologies]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''TABLE 4'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Svarte Ture Jönsson also called "Thure Swarte Jonsson" and "Thure Jonsson Swarte".''' Said to be 50 years old in 1477, although he is mentioned in letters before the 60-year-old brother Åke in 1477. Appears at the earliest in 1
2 CONC 440 and then without a knighthood, but had one on 1.2 1442, which is why he must have been dubbed at the coronation of King Kristofer on 14.9 1441. Mentioned as a councilor from 1453 and as a lawman in Västergötland from 1454 and 
2 CONC again in 1480. In 1457 he became a chieftain at Ax vall, where he 1462 was succeeded by his brother Åke. Still alive 10.2 1481 and died 28.4 the same year and was buried in Vadstena. Married at the latest in 1455 to Birgitta Henri
2 CONC ksdotter, who was still alive in 1500 and was the daughter of the Riksdag Henrik Snakenborg , whose wife's name is not known.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Märta Turedotter.''' Ordained as a nun in Vadstena monastery 5.8 1470. Elected 16.5 1496 as abbess there and consecrated 25.7 s.å. but resigned 20.2 1501
2 CONT * '''Henrik Tureson.''' Died no earlier than 1.5 1481.
2 CONT * '''Ragnhild Turedotter,''' married, to Peder Bonde, who belonged to the family Sparre af Rossvik , was still alive in 1481 and had previously been married to Ingegärd Toredotter ( Byting ).
2 CONT * '''Ölgard'''. Still alive 30.7 1497. — Was married on 1.5 1481 to the district chief of Oppunda hd in Södermanland Peder Bragde, who remarried Cecilia Magnusdotter ( Gren ) at the latest in 1505, not mentioned in later life and 
2 CONC died in 1508.
2 CONT * '''Karin Turedotter,''' Died 24.2 1500 and was buried in Halmstad's Franciscan monastery. Married between 1481 and 6.12 1489 to the knight Bengt Åkeson ( Tott ), who since 1475 was the widower of Märta Eringisledotter ( Gädda ) 
2 CONC and died in 1500.
