2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.digitale-sammlungen.de/en/view/bsb10328239?page=112
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Perhaps the Elin married to Magnus in this profile should be reconnected to Elin Nilsdotter Kurki?
