1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Peder Hakansson, till [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hagelsrum Hagelsrum]=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Hakon Hand, till Wi i [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/L%C3%B6ts_socken,_%C3%96sterg%C3%B6tland Loths socken] Östergothland 
2 CONT * [http://runeberg.org/anrep/2/0199.html '''Peder Håkansson'''], lefde 1440. Gift med Carin Göstafsdotter, af Äldre Stenbockeslägten; dotter af Riddaren och Riks-Rådet samt Höfvidmannen på [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Old_%C3%84
2 CONC lvsborg Elfvaborg] Herr Göstaf Ololofsson, till Tofta, med hans 1:a fru, Ingrid af Winstorpa slägt; Riks-Rådet Bengt Uddesons till Ulfsberg dotter. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Peter Håkansson, was alive in 1440. Married to Karin Gustafsdotter of the older Stenbock family, daughter of knight and stuff, [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Stenbock,_%C3%A4ldre_%C3%A4tten#TAB_4 Gustaf Olsson], till [htt
2 CONC ps://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tofta_herrg%C3%A5rd Tofta] and his first wife, Ingrid of Vinstorpa family, daughter of [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Vinstorpa%C3%A4tten#TAB_2 Bengt Uddsson], till [https://www.bing.com/maps?&ty=
2 CONC 18&q=Tofta%20Ulfsberg%2C%20355%2092%20Tofta%20Ulfsberg%2C%20Ruotsi&ppois=56.9558613028031_14.8746409474857_Tofta%20Ulfsberg%2C%20355%2092%20Tofta%20Ulfsberg%2C%20Ruotsi_~&cp=56.955861~14.874641&v=2&sV=1&FORM=MIRE&qpvt=Ulfsberg Ulf
2 CONC sberg].
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Löts socken''' ingick i Memmings härad och uppgick i Borgs socken 1803. Området ligger idag i Norrköpings kommun. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Loth, or '''Löt''', today, is located in [https://www.geni.com/projects/Municipality-of-Norrk%C3%B6ping-East-Gothland-Sweden/3059426 Norrköping], in [https://www.geni.com/projects/East-Gothland-Sweden/49631 Östergötland].
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hagelsrum Hagelsrum] ligger mellan [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/M%C3%A5lilla Målilla] och [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hultsfred Hultsfred]. Då Målilla numera är en tätort i Hultsfreds kommun, 
2 CONC måste Hagelsum ha funnits i nuvarand Hulstfred kommun.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Hagelsrum is located between Målilla and Hultsfred, and given that Målilla today is part of of the municipality of Hultsfred, then Hagelsrum is located in [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hultsfred_Municipality Hultsfred]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000003897563085?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000118153818821 '''Carin Gustafsdotter (Stenbock, older family),'''] daughter of the knight and the Swedish National Council Gust
2 CONC af Olofsson (Stenbock, older family) and Ingrid Bengtsdotter (Vinstorpaätten) 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Nils Pedersson;''' Fick i Wadstena Got in Wadstena 1508, St. Gertud's day. of the Riksforestandaren Svante Sture freedom and boldness and to the arms a white hand in a red fell. (On [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gertrude_of_
2 CONC Nivelles St. Gerdrud's say] (1508-03-17) in Vadstena, the Regent of Sweden, [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Svante_Nilsson_(regent_of_Sweden% Svante Nilsson], granted Nils Pedersson a [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fr%C3%A4lse fräl
2 CONC se] privilegion as well as the right to bear a coat-of-arms of a white hand against red background). Fick i [https://www.geni.com/projects/Municipality-of-Vadstena-Ostrogothia-Sweden/1898796 Wadstena] 1508, [https://sv.wikipedia.o
2 CONC rg/wiki/Gertrud_av_Nivelles S:t Gertruda dag] (17 mars) af Riksföreståndaren [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Svante_Nilsson_(Sture%29 Svante Sture] frihet och [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fr%C3%A4lse frälse] same en vapen en [htt
2 CONC ps://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hand_(sl%C3%A4kt%29 hvit hand i rödt fält]. 
2 CONT *''' Peder Pedersson, till Hagalsrum,''' (son of Peder Håkansson, Tab. 1), to Hagelsrum in Målilla parish and Ca) mare county and Dansjö in Lekaryd parish and Kronoberg county. Married Christina Håkansdotter, af Wångaslägten; daug
2 CONC hter of the Höfvidsmannen in Westeråa Håkan Svensson (Bölja or Strömfelt), to Bodshult, who carried three currents in the coat of arms, with Anna; King Carl Knutsson's (Farmer) daughter, with his 3rd wife, Christina Abrahamsdotter
2 CONC .  See [http://runeberg.org/anrep/2/0200.html Tab. 2]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''' [http://runeberg.org/anrep/2/0200.html Swedish nobility's tables / Department 2. Granfelt from Dal - Mörner af Tuna / 196]
2 CONT
