2 CONT =Elsa Bengtsdotter (ållongren)=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * Måns Påvelsson , to Broxvik and Förenäs. Was a squire in 1508. Brought 1519-11-08 only one Sparre in the weapon. District chief in Norra Vedbo district 1520 2 . Enumerated among the freedmen liable to service in Småland in 1526 
2 CONC and 1528. 1 He is said to have pledged the mother's estate to the burgher of Vadstena Lars Persson in 1523, but they were redeemed by the son Erik Månsson, who received the Viste county court's fasting letter on Broxvik's estate i
2 CONC n 1546, the Wednesday before St. Botolf's Day (16/6). Married to Elin Larsdotter , daughter of the gunsmith Lars Svensson (bølja) of Ljusfors, and his 1st wife Elsa Bengtsdotter (ållongren).
