0 @N6000000005076664239@ NOTE Matilda of England was born in June 1156 at Windsor Castle, Windsor, Berkshire, England.3 She was the daughter of Henry II 'Curtmantle' d'Anjou, King of England and Eleanor, Duchesse d'Aquitaine. She married Heinrich V Herzog von 
1 CONC Braunschweig-Lüneburg, son of Heinrich X Herzog von Bayern and Gertrude von Sachsen, on 1 February 1168 at Minden Cathedral, Minden, Nordrhein-Westfahlen, Germany.3 She died on 28 June 1189 at Braunschweig, Germany.1 She was burie
1 CONC d at Brunswick Cathedral, Braunschweig, Germany.1
1 CONT      Matilda of England was also known as Maud of England.
1 CONT Children of Matilda of England and Heinrich V Herzog von Braunschweig-Lüneburg
1 CONT Eleanor von Sachsen 4
1 CONT Ingibiorg von Sachsen+ 4
