0 @N6000000007978029213@ NOTE BIOGRAPHY: Fourth King of Portugal, from 26 Mar 1223 to 4 Nov 1248.
0 @N6000000000374518059@ NOTE BIOGRAPHY: Fifth King of Portugal, from 1248 to 16 Feb 1279.
0 @N6000000002322303321@ NOTE Supplanting his brother, Sancho II, his reign saw the first meeting of the
1 CONT Portuguese Cortes (Parliament) in which the commoners of the municipalities
1 CONT were represented. Despite the help he received to become king, he took the
1 CONT same attitude as his predecessors about the reposession of church lands and
1 CONT was, like them, excomminicated. On his death, he was succeeded by his son,
1 CONT Dinis (Denis).
0 @N6000000002176654542@ NOTE Supplanting his brother, Sancho II, his reign saw the first meeting of the
