1 CONT Maud of Savoy
1 CONT Father's mother:
1 CONT Dulce Berenguer of Aragon Father's mother's father:
1 CONT Ramon Berenguer IV, Count of Barcelona
1 CONT Father's mother's mother:
1 CONT Petronila of Aragon
1 CONT Mother:
1 CONT Urraca of Castile Mother's father:
1 CONT Alfonso VIII of Castile Mother's father's father:
1 CONT Sancho III of Castile
1 CONT Mother's father's mother:
1 CONT Blanca of Navarre
1 CONT Mother's mother:
1 CONT Leonora of England Mother's mother's father:
1 CONT Henry II of England
1 CONT Mother's mother's mother:
1 CONT Eleanor of Aquitaine
1 CONT
1 CONT ==Marriages and descendants and he was a great christian leader and believed in god Afonso's first wife was Matilda II of Boulogne, daughter of Renaud, Count of Dammartin, and Ida of Boulogne. She had two sons (Roberto and an unna
1 CONC med one), but both died young. He divorced Matilda in 1253 and, in the same year, married Beatrix of Castile, illegitimate daughter of Alfonso X, King of Castile, and Maria de Guzman.
1 CONT
