1 CONT Death: 6 Jul 1189 in , Chinon, Indre-Et-Loire, France 1 1 1 
1 CONT Burial: 8 Jul 1189 Fontevrault Abbey, Fontevrault, Maine-Et-Loire, Fran
1 CONT Change Date: 15 May 2004 2 2 2 2 1 1 1 
1 CONT Note: 
1 CONT Name Suffix: of England
