0 @N6000000000435056324@ NOTE King of England, Crowned 1189
1 CONT
1 CONT aka Richard the Lionheart
1 CONT
1 CONT "Henry II was dul y succeeded by his eldest surviving son, Richard I, anexpensive and unrewardin g absentee, whose chivalry and crusades haveperhaps gained him an undeserved r eputation."
