1 CONT Eleanor was baptized by Cardinal Henry of Pisa.  Her godfather was Rob ert of Torigni.  At the time of her sister Joan's death 24 September 1 199, Eleanor was in Castile.  It is reported that she maintained a ver y gracious court 
