1 CONC ichard, Earl of Cornwall, to Launceston Priory in Cornwall.  In 1240 he joined Earl Richard on a crusade to the Holy Land.  EUDES FITZ ROY died there testate shortly before 21 Jan. 1241/2.  His lands in Essex were granted to Giles
