1 CONT Charles IV who was one of the most learned and diplomatically skilled
1 CONT soverigns of his time. He gained more through diplomacy than others did by
1 CONT war, and through purchases, marriages, and inheritances, he enlarged his
1 CONT dynasty power. Under Charles's rule, Prague became the political, economic,
1 CONT and cultural centre of the Holy Roman Empire, and, eventully, its capital.
